{"id":"87bee95cbaea0934","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-inverse-limit.md","title":"Inverse Limit","display":"df-inverse-limit — Inverse Limit","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-inverse-limit","aliases":["93-df-inverse-limit"],"display":"df-inverse-limit — Inverse Limit","depends_on":["[[93-df-relation-composition]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]","[[93-df-product]]","[[93-df-homomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-inverse-limit"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-inverse-limit</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-inverse-limit — Inverse Limit"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e8852a067d7d040c\" href=\"?note=e8852a067d7d040c\" title=\"93-df-relation-composition\">93-df-relation-composition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"260c377f5e1dcfdf\" href=\"?note=260c377f5e1dcfdf\" title=\"93-df-product\">93-df-product</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" href=\"?note=f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" title=\"93-df-homomorphism\">93-df-homomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> is an index-set candidate, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq I^2\">\\(R\\subseteq I^2\\)</span> is a directed partial-order candidate (with the empty diagram allowed), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A:I\\to V\">\\(\\mathbf A:I\\to V\\)</span> is an algebra family of one fixed type <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf p\">\\(\\mathbf p\\)</span> is a bonding-map family on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}\\)</span> are the sourced algebra and homomorphism predicates, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{id}_X\">\\(\\mathrm{id}_X\\)</span> denotes the identity graph on a displayed set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProdCar}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProdCar}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProdOp}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProdOp}_{93}\\)</span> are the explicit product carrier and operation graphs of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"260c377f5e1dcfdf\" href=\"?note=260c377f5e1dcfdf\" title=\"93-df-product\">93-df-product</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BondDom}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{BondDom}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{InvCar}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{InvCar}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LimOp}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{LimOp}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LimOpFam}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{LimOpFam}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InvLim}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{InvLim}_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\)</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=\\varnothing\">\\(I=\\varnothing\\)</span> 时不能从空族的逐点代数条件反推出该条件。各运算构造中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\pi_1(\\tau)\">\\(f\\in\\pi_1(\\tau)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BondDom}_{93}(I,R)\">\\(\\operatorname{BondDom}_{93}(I,R)\\)</span> 的参数满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in V\">\\(I\\in V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq I^2\">\\(R\\subseteq I^2\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{InvCar}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf p;I,R)\">\\(\\operatorname{InvCar}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf p;I,R)\\)</span> 的定义域为上述 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,R\">\\(I,R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A:I\\to V\">\\(\\mathbf A:I\\to V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall i\\in I\\;\\exists A_i,\\mathbf o_i\\in V\\;(\\mathbf A(i)=\\langle A_i,\\mathbf o_i\\rangle)\">\\(\\forall i\\in I\\;\\exists A_i,\\mathbf o_i\\in V\\;(\\mathbf A(i)=\\langle A_i,\\mathbf o_i\\rangle)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf p:\\operatorname{BondDom}_{93}(I,R)\\to V\">\\(\\mathbf p:\\operatorname{BondDom}_{93}(I,R)\\to V\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{BondDom}_{93}(I,R)\\;(\\mathbf p(\\langle i,j\\rangle):|\\mathbf A(j)|\\to|\\mathbf A(i)|)\">\\(\\forall\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{BondDom}_{93}(I,R)\\;(\\mathbf p(\\langle i,j\\rangle):|\\mathbf A(j)|\\to|\\mathbf A(i)|)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LimOp}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{LimOp}_{93}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LimOpFam}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{LimOpFam}_{93}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InvLim}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{InvLim}_{93}\\)</span> 另要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A(i))\">\\(\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A(i))\\)</span>。这些构造的定义域不附加有向性、同态性、相容性或极限载集非空条件；这些条件只在下方相应蕴含式中使用。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}limit}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BondDom}_{93}(I,R)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in I^2:\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}limit}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BondDom}_{93}(I,R)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in I^2:\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}limit}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{InvCar}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf p;I,R)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{a\\in\\operatorname{ProdCar}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I):\n\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\to\n\\mathbf p(\\langle i,j\\rangle)(a(j))=a(i)\\Bigr)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}limit}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{InvCar}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf p;I,R)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{a\\in\\operatorname{ProdCar}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I):\n\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\to\n\\mathbf p(\\langle i,j\\rangle)(a(j))=a(i)\\Bigr)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}limit}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{LimOp}_{93}(f;\\mathbf A,\\mathbf p,I,R,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{ProdOp}_{93}(f;\\mathbf A,I,\\tau)\\!\\upharpoonright\n\\operatorname{InvCar}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf p;I,R)^{\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}limit}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{LimOp}_{93}(f;\\mathbf A,\\mathbf p,I,R,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{ProdOp}_{93}(f;\\mathbf A,I,\\tau)\\!\\upharpoonright\n\\operatorname{InvCar}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf p;I,R)^{\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}limit}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{LimOpFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf p;I,R,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle f,\n\\operatorname{LimOp}_{93}(f;\\mathbf A,\\mathbf p,I,R,\\tau)\n\\right\\rangle:f\\in\\pi_1(\\tau)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}limit}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{LimOpFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf p;I,R,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle f,\n\\operatorname{LimOp}_{93}(f;\\mathbf A,\\mathbf p,I,R,\\tau)\n\\right\\rangle:f\\in\\pi_1(\\tau)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}limit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{InvLim}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf p;I,R,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle\n\\operatorname{InvCar}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf p;I,R),\n\\operatorname{LimOpFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf p;I,R,\\tau)\n\\right\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}limit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{InvLim}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf p;I,R,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle\n\\operatorname{InvCar}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf p;I,R),\n\\operatorname{LimOpFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf p;I,R,\\tau)\n\\right\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}limit}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land I\\in V\\land R\\subseteq I^2\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\langle i,i\\rangle\\in R)\n\\land\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in R\\to\\langle i,k\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle j,i\\rangle\\in R\\to i=j)\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\exists k\\in I\\;(\\langle i,k\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathbf A:I\\to V\n\\land\\mathbf p:\\operatorname{BondDom}_{93}(I,R)\\to V\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A(i))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\to\n\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}\\bigl(\\mathbf p(\\langle i,j\\rangle),\n\\mathbf A(j),\\mathbf A(i)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathbf p(\\langle i,i\\rangle)=\\mathrm{id}_{|\\mathbf A(i)|}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in R\\to\n\\mathbf p(\\langle i,k\\rangle)=\n\\mathbf p(\\langle i,j\\rangle)\\circ\\mathbf p(\\langle j,k\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{InvCar}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf p;I,R)\\neq\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\Bigl[\n\\forall f\\in\\pi_1(\\tau)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{LimOp}_{93}(f;\\mathbf A,\\mathbf p,I,R,\\tau):\n\\operatorname{InvCar}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf p;I,R)^{\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)}\n\\to\\operatorname{InvCar}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf p;I,R)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{InvLim}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf p;I,R,\\tau)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}limit}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land I\\in V\\land R\\subseteq I^2\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\langle i,i\\rangle\\in R)\n\\land\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in R\\to\\langle i,k\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle j,i\\rangle\\in R\\to i=j)\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\exists k\\in I\\;(\\langle i,k\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathbf A:I\\to V\n\\land\\mathbf p:\\operatorname{BondDom}_{93}(I,R)\\to V\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A(i))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\to\n\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}\\bigl(\\mathbf p(\\langle i,j\\rangle),\n\\mathbf A(j),\\mathbf A(i)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathbf p(\\langle i,i\\rangle)=\\mathrm{id}_{|\\mathbf A(i)|}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in R\\to\n\\mathbf p(\\langle i,k\\rangle)=\n\\mathbf p(\\langle i,j\\rangle)\\circ\\mathbf p(\\langle j,k\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{InvCar}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf p;I,R)\\neq\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\Bigl[\n\\forall f\\in\\pi_1(\\tau)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{LimOp}_{93}(f;\\mathbf A,\\mathbf p,I,R,\\tau):\n\\operatorname{InvCar}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf p;I,R)^{\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)}\n\\to\\operatorname{InvCar}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf p;I,R)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{InvLim}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf p;I,R,\\tau)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Homomorphism of each bonding map proves that the inverse-limit carrier is closed under the restricted product operations. The carrier uses direct membership in the explicit relation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>; the comparable-pair domain, both family functions, every operation graph, index set, and type are constructor data.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark"